Package: com.sushibta.vmlspeedbubble
Name: VMLSpeedBubble
Version: 16.13-templatehost-weather1
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64e
Description: Google Maps CarPlay weather build that caches destination from CPSPagingTripPreviewsCardView inside CarPlayTemplateUIHost, detects active navigation via CPSNavigationETAView, geocodes the destination, fetches Open-Meteo current weather and sends it to the CarPlay overlay receiver.
Maintainer: sushibta25-design
Author: sushibta25-design
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate | ellekit
